config.nether_api.compat.bop.dependentHellBiomes=World-Type Dependency (Nether)
config.nether_api.compat.bop.dependentHellBiomes.tooltip=Nether biomes from the Biomes O' Plenty mod can only generate if the world-type is set to "Biomes O' Plenty".
config.nether_api.compat.bop.placeableNetherFluids=Placeable Nether Fluids
config.nether_api.compat.bop.placeableNetherFluids.tooltip=Allow the fluids from Biomes O' Plenty that already generate in the Nether (Blood and Honey) to not vaporize in the Nether when placed by a bucket.
