config.nether_api.compat.natura.limitNaturaNetherGenerators=Limit Nether Generators
config.nether_api.compat.natura.limitNaturaNetherGenerators.tooltip=Whether Natura's nether features should only generate in specified biomes (only the Vanilla nether biome is specified by default). Disable this setting to generate Natura's nether features in all nether biomes.
