config.nether_api.compat.netherex.fortressBiomeVariants=Nether Fortress Biome Variants
config.nether_api.compat.netherex.fortressBiomeVariants.tooltip=While enabled, Nether Fortresses that originate from NetherEx biomes use that biome's corresponding bricks.
config.nether_api.compat.netherex.fortressGloomyForSoulSand=Nether Fortress Biome Variants (Soul Sand)
config.nether_api.compat.netherex.fortressGloomyForSoulSand.tooltip=While enabled, Nether Fortresses that originate from any biome with soul sand as its top block will use gloomy nether bricks.\nRequires "Nether Fortress Biome Variants" to be enabled.
config.nether_api.compat.netherex.fortressSpawnsFrost=Nether Fortress Biome Variants (Frost)
config.nether_api.compat.netherex.fortressSpawnsFrost.tooltip=While enabled, Nether Fortresses that originate from NetherEx's arctic abyss biome generate its Frost mob instead of Blazes.\nRequires "Nether Fortress Biome Variants" to be enabled.
